    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bean Busy is an early 80s inspired maze chase game with lots to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 Unique Levels with additional Bonus Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All manner of Hazards and Tools to find during your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Numerous Monsters with distinct AI patterns to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cooperative play, with accommodated Stage design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Controller Support for 1 or 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that Loops Indefinitely for the truly Super Players!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Controls:</u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player 1 uses WSAD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2 uses Arrow Keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Launch the game with 1 or 2 controllers already plugged in for them to map correctly)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pressing &quot;1&quot; Starts a 1-Player game, and &quot;2&quot; Starts a 2-Player game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Holding alt and pressing enter will enable/disable true fullscreen mode </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for checking out Bean Busy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Credits:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hornbuckle Who - Game<br>Joaquin Masimelli - Spanish Localization</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bean Busy is an early 80s inspired maze chase game with lots to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 Unique Levels with additional Bonus Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All manner of Hazards and Tools to find during your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Numerous Monsters with distinct AI patterns to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cooperative play, with accommodated Stage design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Controller Support for 1 or 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that Loops Indefinitely for the truly Super Players!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Controls:</u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player 1 uses WSAD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2 uses Arrow Keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Launch the game with 1 or 2 controllers already plugged in for them to map correctly)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pressing &quot;1&quot; Starts a 1-Player game, and &quot;2&quot; Starts a 2-Player game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Holding alt and pressing enter will enable/disable true fullscreen mode </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for checking out Bean Busy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Credits:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hornbuckle Who - Game<br>Joaquin Masimelli - Spanish Localization</p>",
